    "detailed_description": "<h1>My next game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Unknown creatures have occupied the Earth and devastated the streets of cities. A lone hero comes out of cover to give the monsters a good fight. Does he have a chance to change the situation?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use gun and chainsaw to kill various monsters in distant and close combat. <br></li><li>Collect an arsenal of powerful weapons with different impact on enemy creatures.<br></li><li>Play in various locations with different content.<br></li><li>Kill enemies in close combat with chainsaw to regain your health.<br></li><li>Freely use the grapple hook to overcome obstacles. <br></li><li>Enjoy unique visual style of the game!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Unknown creatures have occupied the Earth and devastated the streets of cities. A lone hero comes out of cover to give the monsters a good fight. Does he have a chance to change the situation?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use gun and chainsaw to kill various monsters in distant and close combat. <br></li><li>Collect an arsenal of powerful weapons with different impact on enemy creatures.<br></li><li>Play in various locations with different content.<br></li><li>Kill enemies in close combat with chainsaw to regain your health.<br></li><li>Freely use the grapple hook to overcome obstacles. <br></li><li>Enjoy unique visual style of the game!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hatchpunk is a retro first person shooter with unique visual style. You have a gun in one hand and a chainsaw in other hand. So come out and face the hordes of monsters that have invaded Earth. Use grapple hook for efficient movement. Kill enemies in close combat with chainsaw to regain your health.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
